          <p class="text-xs text-[#8B7355] dark:text-[#B8A890] leading-relaxed">More staying power for accounts and handoffs that stick around.<br/>3 words + symbol + number<br/>e.g. <span class="text-[#4A3728] dark:text-[#F0E6D8] font-mono font-bold">DancingKoalaRiver!73</span></p>
